523: 	 * itself, so the only thing to supply is which action to run. The action
524: 	 * constants are {@code ACTION_*} and carry the values stored in
525: 	 * {@code M_Requisition.DocAction}, so the normal iDempiere preparation,
526: 	 * rules and logging all run exactly as they would from the window.
527: 	 * <p>
528: 	 * In this build {@code processIt} answers with a boolean, and the document
529: 	 * status is checked as well, because a document can report success and still
530: 	 * be left short of completed.
